Generate calls esutils.FetchServiceAccountToken, which builds a client from ctrlcfg.GetConfig(). Pointing KUBECONFIG at an httptest server lets the test cover the full Generate path without a production refactor. The auth value reads the username from the map, not from a credential-named variable or const, to keep CodeQL go/hardcoded-credentials quiet. Manual e2e on OrbStack passed: Cloudsmith OIDC provider with uploaded JWKS, Argo CD repo secret pulled the private OCI chart (HTTP 200), wrong namespace got 401.
